  "body": "Imagine creating a home that's designed around the way you live, waking up to beautiful sea views, relaxing beside your own private swimming pool, and enjoying a home that's uniquely yours.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Long Bay's most prestigious coastal neighbourhoods, this premium Home & Land Package presents a rare opportunity to build a luxury residence where contemporary design meets breathtaking coastal living. Thoughtfully designed to maximise the stunning outlook, the proposed home seamlessly connects elegant indoor living with resort-style outdoor entertaining.\r\n\r\nFeaturing 5 bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, multiple living areas, spectacular sea views and a private swimming pool, this exceptional design offers both luxury and flexibility. Better still, selected design elements and finishes can be personalised to suit your family's lifestyle and preferences, subject to developer approval and the stage of construction.\r\n\r\nWhether you dream of hosting unforgettable summer gatherings by the pool, enjoying peaceful mornings overlooking the sea, or creating a forever home tailored to your family, this is your opportunity to build something truly special in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal communities.\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Love It:\r\n\r\n• Premium Home & Land Package \r\n• Beautiful sea views \r\n• Private resort-style swimming pool \r\n• Opportunity to personalise selected design elements \r\n• 5 spacious bedrooms \r\n• 4.5 luxury bathrooms \r\n• Multiple living areas \r\n• Designer kitchen \r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor living \r\n• Double internal-access garage \r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee \r\n\r\n\r\nMore than just a Home & Land Package, it's your chance to create a home that's uniquely yours, with beautiful sea views, a private pool and a lifestyle to match.\r\nContact us today to learn more.\r\n\r\n\r\nConjunctional Agents Welcome.\r\nWe welcome conjunctional agents and look forward to working together to help buyers discover this exceptional home.",
